-- 中文操作说明：恢复库存提醒隔离，两张独立侧表；MySQL 5.7.18（可带供应商后缀，禁止MariaDB）。
-- 必须先SQL后代码：暂停恢复、暂停并排空旧库存通知工作进程 → 单独01预检 → 批准后02升级 → 单独03后检READY → 全部工作进程部署新版 → 恢复运行。
-- 结构缺失/部分/不符/不可读时新版暂停全部库存通知和含库存恢复；其他提醒不因本模块结构缺失暂停。
-- 只保护新版以后新恢复的库存；无法可靠识别此前历史恢复库存。不回填、不批量改库存、不自动启用。
-- 已有库只运行增量01/02/03；空库另用新init入口。旧SQL不重跑，不可用init升级已有库；root/cn同一库只选一套。
-- FULLY_INSTALLED跳过02；PARTIAL_OR_UNKNOWN或错误保持暂停，不能--force、盲重跑或自动补齐。
-- DDL隐式提交，可能等待元数据锁；不保证原子回滚、在线无锁或耗时。先验证完整数据库备份可恢复和权限/空间。
-- 已存在恢复标记后禁止回退旧应用，旧代码忽略OFF。数据库恢复必须连同两侧表；合法物理删除源库存时级联结束标记/回执寿命。
-- 本交付仅SQL源文；真实MySQL5.7语法/触发器/级联/锁行为、真实通知及部署均未验证。
-- 操作者明确核对目标库和连接，使用交互密码，禁止将凭据写入脚本：mysql --batch --default-character-set=utf8mb4 --host=HOST --port=PORT --user=USER --password --database=DB < SCRIPT.sql
-- 只读预检：READY只跳过新增，不代表部署/历史数据已验证。
SET @asn57_absent=(DATABASE() IS NOT NULL AND (VERSION()='5.7.18' OR VERSION() LIKE '5.7.18-%') AND LOWER(VERSION()) NOT LIKE '%mariadb%' AND (FIND_IN_SET('STRICT_TRANS_TABLES',@@SESSION.sql_mode)>0 OR FIND_IN_SET('STRICT_ALL_TABLES',@@SESSION.sql_mode)>0) AND @@SESSION.foreign_key_checks=1 AND @@SESSION.unique_checks=1 AND (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.TABLES WHERE BINARY TABLE_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY TABLE_NAME='medication_stock' AND TABLE_TYPE='BASE TABLE' AND ENGINE='InnoDB')=1 AND (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.COLUMNS WHERE BINARY TABLE_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY TABLE_NAME='medication_stock' AND BINARY COLUMN_NAME='id' AND LOWER(COLUMN_TYPE)='bigint(20)' AND IS_NULLABLE='NO' AND COLUMN_DEFAULT IS NULL AND LOWER(EXTRA)='auto_increment')=1 AND (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.STATISTICS WHERE BINARY TABLE_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY TABLE_NAME='medication_stock' AND BINARY INDEX_NAME='PRIMARY')=1 AND (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.STATISTICS WHERE BINARY TABLE_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY TABLE_NAME='medication_stock' AND BINARY INDEX_NAME='PRIMARY' AND NON_UNIQUE=0 AND SEQ_IN_INDEX=1 AND BINARY COLUMN_NAME='id' AND SUB_PART IS NULL AND INDEX_TYPE='BTREE' AND COLLATION='A')=1 AND (SELECT CASE WHEN DATABASE() IS NULL THEN NULL ELSE (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.TABLES WHERE BINARY TABLE_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY LEFT(TABLE_NAME,27)=BINARY 'archive_stock_notification_')+(SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.TRIGGERS WHERE BINARY TRIGGER_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND (BINARY EVENT_OBJECT_TABLE IN ('archive_stock_notification_state','archive_stock_notification_command') OR BINARY LEFT(TRIGGER_NAME,6)=BINARY 'asn57_'))+(SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.ROUTINES WHERE BINARY ROUTINE_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY LEFT(ROUTINE_NAME,6)=BINARY 'asn57_')+(SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.EVENTS WHERE BINARY EVENT_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY LEFT(EVENT_NAME,6)=BINARY 'asn57_')+(SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.STATISTICS WHERE BINARY TABLE_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY LEFT(INDEX_NAME,6)=BINARY 'asn57_')+(SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.TABLE_CONSTRAINTS WHERE BINARY CONSTRAINT_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY LEFT(CONSTRAINT_NAME,6)=BINARY 'asn57_') END AS present)=0);
SET @asn57_ready=(SELECT CASE WHEN
  DATABASE() IS NOT NULL AND (VERSION()='5.7.18' OR VERSION() LIKE '5.7.18-%') AND LOWER(VERSION()) NOT LIKE '%mariadb%' AND (FIND_IN_SET('STRICT_TRANS_TABLES',@@SESSION.sql_mode)>0 OR FIND_IN_SET('STRICT_ALL_TABLES',@@SESSION.sql_mode)>0) AND @@SESSION.foreign_key_checks=1 AND @@SESSION.unique_checks=1 AND
  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.TABLES WHERE BINARY TABLE_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY TABLE_NAME='medication_stock' AND TABLE_TYPE='BASE TABLE' AND ENGINE='InnoDB')=1 AND
  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.COLUMNS WHERE BINARY TABLE_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY TABLE_NAME='medication_stock' AND BINARY COLUMN_NAME='id' AND LOWER(COLUMN_TYPE)='bigint(20)' AND IS_NULLABLE='NO' AND COLUMN_DEFAULT IS NULL AND LOWER(EXTRA)='auto_increment')=1 AND
  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.STATISTICS WHERE BINARY TABLE_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY TABLE_NAME='medication_stock' AND BINARY INDEX_NAME='PRIMARY')=1 AND
  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.STATISTICS WHERE BINARY TABLE_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY TABLE_NAME='medication_stock' AND BINARY INDEX_NAME='PRIMARY' AND NON_UNIQUE=0 AND SEQ_IN_INDEX=1 AND BINARY COLUMN_NAME='id' AND SUB_PART IS NULL AND INDEX_TYPE='BTREE' AND COLLATION='A')=1 AND
  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.TABLES WHERE BINARY TABLE_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY LEFT(TABLE_NAME,27)=BINARY 'archive_stock_notification_')=2 AND
  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.TABLES WHERE BINARY TABLE_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY TABLE_NAME='archive_stock_notification_state' AND TABLE_TYPE='BASE TABLE' AND ENGINE='InnoDB' AND ROW_FORMAT='Dynamic' AND TABLE_COLLATION='utf8mb4_bin')=1 AND
  (SELECT COUNT(*)=6 AND SUM(CASE WHEN (BINARY COLUMN_NAME='stock_id' AND LOWER(COLUMN_TYPE)='bigint(20)' AND IS_NULLABLE='NO' AND (BINARY COLUMN_DEFAULT <=> NULL) AND LOWER(EXTRA)='' AND ORDINAL_POSITION=1 AND CHARACTER_SET_NAME IS NULL AND COLLATION_NAME IS NULL) OR (BINARY COLUMN_NAME='enabled' AND LOWER(COLUMN_TYPE)='tinyint(4)' AND IS_NULLABLE='NO' AND (BINARY COLUMN_DEFAULT <=> '0') AND LOWER(EXTRA)='' AND ORDINAL_POSITION=2 AND CHARACTER_SET_NAME IS NULL AND COLLATION_NAME IS NULL) OR (BINARY COLUMN_NAME='control_version' AND LOWER(COLUMN_TYPE)='bigint(20)' AND IS_NULLABLE='NO' AND (BINARY COLUMN_DEFAULT <=> '0') AND LOWER(EXTRA)='' AND ORDINAL_POSITION=3 AND CHARACTER_SET_NAME IS NULL AND COLLATION_NAME IS NULL) OR (BINARY COLUMN_NAME='enabled_after_stock_version' AND LOWER(COLUMN_TYPE)='bigint(20)' AND IS_NULLABLE='NO' AND (BINARY COLUMN_DEFAULT <=> '0') AND LOWER(EXTRA)='' AND ORDINAL_POSITION=4 AND CHARACTER_SET_NAME IS NULL AND COLLATION_NAME IS NULL) OR (BINARY COLUMN_NAME='restored_at' AND LOWER(COLUMN_TYPE)='datetime(6)' AND IS_NULLABLE='NO' AND (BINARY COLUMN_DEFAULT <=> NULL) AND LOWER(EXTRA)='' AND ORDINAL_POSITION=5 AND CHARACTER_SET_NAME IS NULL AND COLLATION_NAME IS NULL) OR (BINARY COLUMN_NAME='updated_at' AND LOWER(COLUMN_TYPE)='datetime(6)' AND IS_NULLABLE='NO' AND (BINARY COLUMN_DEFAULT <=> NULL) AND LOWER(EXTRA)='' AND ORDINAL_POSITION=6 AND CHARACTER_SET_NAME IS NULL AND COLLATION_NAME IS NULL) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)=6 FROM information_schema.COLUMNS WHERE BINARY TABLE_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY TABLE_NAME='archive_stock_notification_state') AND
  (SELECT COUNT(*)=1 AND SUM(CASE WHEN (BINARY INDEX_NAME='PRIMARY' AND NON_UNIQUE=0 AND SEQ_IN_INDEX=1 AND BINARY COLUMN_NAME='stock_id' AND SUB_PART IS NULL AND INDEX_TYPE='BTREE' AND COLLATION='A') THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)=1 FROM information_schema.STATISTICS WHERE BINARY TABLE_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY TABLE_NAME='archive_stock_notification_state') AND
  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.KEY_COLUMN_USAGE k JOIN information_schema.REFERENTIAL_CONSTRAINTS r ON BINARY r.CONSTRAINT_SCHEMA=BINARY k.CONSTRAINT_SCHEMA AND BINARY r.CONSTRAINT_NAME=BINARY k.CONSTRAINT_NAME AND BINARY r.TABLE_NAME=BINARY k.TABLE_NAME WHERE BINARY k.TABLE_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY k.TABLE_NAME='archive_stock_notification_state' AND BINARY k.CONSTRAINT_NAME='asn57_state_stock' AND BINARY k.COLUMN_NAME='stock_id' AND k.ORDINAL_POSITION=1 AND k.POSITION_IN_UNIQUE_CONSTRAINT=1 AND BINARY k.REFERENCED_TABLE_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY k.REFERENCED_TABLE_NAME='medication_stock' AND BINARY k.REFERENCED_COLUMN_NAME='id' AND BINARY r.UNIQUE_CONSTRAINT_NAME='PRIMARY' AND r.DELETE_RULE='CASCADE' AND r.UPDATE_RULE='RESTRICT')=1 AND
  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.KEY_COLUMN_USAGE WHERE BINARY TABLE_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY TABLE_NAME='archive_stock_notification_state' AND REFERENCED_TABLE_NAME IS NOT NULL)=1 AND
  (SELECT COUNT(*)=2 AND SUM(CASE WHEN (BINARY CONSTRAINT_NAME='PRIMARY' AND CONSTRAINT_TYPE='PRIMARY KEY') OR (BINARY CONSTRAINT_NAME='asn57_state_stock' AND CONSTRAINT_TYPE='FOREIGN KEY') THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)=2 FROM information_schema.TABLE_CONSTRAINTS WHERE BINARY TABLE_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY TABLE_NAME='archive_stock_notification_state') AND
  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.TABLES WHERE BINARY TABLE_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY TABLE_NAME='archive_stock_notification_command' AND TABLE_TYPE='BASE TABLE' AND ENGINE='InnoDB' AND ROW_FORMAT='Dynamic' AND TABLE_COLLATION='utf8mb4_bin')=1 AND
  (SELECT COUNT(*)=8 AND SUM(CASE WHEN (BINARY COLUMN_NAME='actor_id' AND LOWER(COLUMN_TYPE)='bigint(20)' AND IS_NULLABLE='NO' AND (BINARY COLUMN_DEFAULT <=> NULL) AND LOWER(EXTRA)='' AND ORDINAL_POSITION=1 AND CHARACTER_SET_NAME IS NULL AND COLLATION_NAME IS NULL) OR (BINARY COLUMN_NAME='command_key' AND LOWER(COLUMN_TYPE)='varchar(64)' AND IS_NULLABLE='NO' AND (BINARY COLUMN_DEFAULT <=> NULL) AND LOWER(EXTRA)='' AND ORDINAL_POSITION=2 AND CHARACTER_SET_NAME='ascii' AND COLLATION_NAME='ascii_bin') OR (BINARY COLUMN_NAME='stock_id' AND LOWER(COLUMN_TYPE)='bigint(20)' AND IS_NULLABLE='NO' AND (BINARY COLUMN_DEFAULT <=> NULL) AND LOWER(EXTRA)='' AND ORDINAL_POSITION=3 AND CHARACTER_SET_NAME IS NULL AND COLLATION_NAME IS NULL) OR (BINARY COLUMN_NAME='expected_version' AND LOWER(COLUMN_TYPE)='bigint(20)' AND IS_NULLABLE='NO' AND (BINARY COLUMN_DEFAULT <=> NULL) AND LOWER(EXTRA)='' AND ORDINAL_POSITION=4 AND CHARACTER_SET_NAME IS NULL AND COLLATION_NAME IS NULL) OR (BINARY COLUMN_NAME='operation' AND LOWER(COLUMN_TYPE)='varchar(7)' AND IS_NULLABLE='NO' AND (BINARY COLUMN_DEFAULT <=> NULL) AND LOWER(EXTRA)='' AND ORDINAL_POSITION=5 AND CHARACTER_SET_NAME='ascii' AND COLLATION_NAME='ascii_bin') OR (BINARY COLUMN_NAME='payload_hash' AND LOWER(COLUMN_TYPE)='char(64)' AND IS_NULLABLE='NO' AND (BINARY COLUMN_DEFAULT <=> NULL) AND LOWER(EXTRA)='' AND ORDINAL_POSITION=6 AND CHARACTER_SET_NAME='ascii' AND COLLATION_NAME='ascii_bin') OR (BINARY COLUMN_NAME='result_json' AND LOWER(COLUMN_TYPE)='varchar(512)' AND IS_NULLABLE='YES' AND (BINARY COLUMN_DEFAULT <=> NULL) AND LOWER(EXTRA)='' AND ORDINAL_POSITION=7 AND CHARACTER_SET_NAME='utf8mb4' AND COLLATION_NAME='utf8mb4_bin') OR (BINARY COLUMN_NAME='created_at' AND LOWER(COLUMN_TYPE)='datetime(6)' AND IS_NULLABLE='NO' AND (BINARY COLUMN_DEFAULT <=> NULL) AND LOWER(EXTRA)='' AND ORDINAL_POSITION=8 AND CHARACTER_SET_NAME IS NULL AND COLLATION_NAME IS NULL) THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)=8 FROM information_schema.COLUMNS WHERE BINARY TABLE_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY TABLE_NAME='archive_stock_notification_command') AND
  (SELECT COUNT(*)=3 AND SUM(CASE WHEN (BINARY INDEX_NAME='PRIMARY' AND NON_UNIQUE=0 AND SEQ_IN_INDEX=1 AND BINARY COLUMN_NAME='actor_id' AND SUB_PART IS NULL AND INDEX_TYPE='BTREE' AND COLLATION='A') OR (BINARY INDEX_NAME='PRIMARY' AND NON_UNIQUE=0 AND SEQ_IN_INDEX=2 AND BINARY COLUMN_NAME='command_key' AND SUB_PART IS NULL AND INDEX_TYPE='BTREE' AND COLLATION='A') OR (BINARY INDEX_NAME='asn57_command_stock' AND NON_UNIQUE=1 AND SEQ_IN_INDEX=1 AND BINARY COLUMN_NAME='stock_id' AND SUB_PART IS NULL AND INDEX_TYPE='BTREE' AND COLLATION='A') THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)=3 FROM information_schema.STATISTICS WHERE BINARY TABLE_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY TABLE_NAME='archive_stock_notification_command') AND
  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.KEY_COLUMN_USAGE k JOIN information_schema.REFERENTIAL_CONSTRAINTS r ON BINARY r.CONSTRAINT_SCHEMA=BINARY k.CONSTRAINT_SCHEMA AND BINARY r.CONSTRAINT_NAME=BINARY k.CONSTRAINT_NAME AND BINARY r.TABLE_NAME=BINARY k.TABLE_NAME WHERE BINARY k.TABLE_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY k.TABLE_NAME='archive_stock_notification_command' AND BINARY k.CONSTRAINT_NAME='asn57_command_state' AND BINARY k.COLUMN_NAME='stock_id' AND k.ORDINAL_POSITION=1 AND k.POSITION_IN_UNIQUE_CONSTRAINT=1 AND BINARY k.REFERENCED_TABLE_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY k.REFERENCED_TABLE_NAME='archive_stock_notification_state' AND BINARY k.REFERENCED_COLUMN_NAME='stock_id' AND BINARY r.UNIQUE_CONSTRAINT_NAME='PRIMARY' AND r.DELETE_RULE='CASCADE' AND r.UPDATE_RULE='RESTRICT')=1 AND
  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.KEY_COLUMN_USAGE WHERE BINARY TABLE_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY TABLE_NAME='archive_stock_notification_command' AND REFERENCED_TABLE_NAME IS NOT NULL)=1 AND
  (SELECT COUNT(*)=2 AND SUM(CASE WHEN (BINARY CONSTRAINT_NAME='PRIMARY' AND CONSTRAINT_TYPE='PRIMARY KEY') OR (BINARY CONSTRAINT_NAME='asn57_command_state' AND CONSTRAINT_TYPE='FOREIGN KEY') THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)=2 FROM information_schema.TABLE_CONSTRAINTS WHERE BINARY TABLE_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY TABLE_NAME='archive_stock_notification_command') AND
  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.TRIGGERS WHERE BINARY TRIGGER_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND (BINARY EVENT_OBJECT_TABLE IN ('archive_stock_notification_state','archive_stock_notification_command') OR BINARY LEFT(TRIGGER_NAME,6)=BINARY 'asn57_'))=6 AND
  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.ROUTINES WHERE BINARY ROUTINE_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY LEFT(ROUTINE_NAME,6)=BINARY 'asn57_')=0 AND
  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.EVENTS WHERE BINARY EVENT_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY LEFT(EVENT_NAME,6)=BINARY 'asn57_')=0 AND
  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.STATISTICS WHERE BINARY TABLE_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY LEFT(INDEX_NAME,6)=BINARY 'asn57_')=1 AND
  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.TABLE_CONSTRAINTS WHERE BINARY CONSTRAINT_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY LEFT(CONSTRAINT_NAME,6)=BINARY 'asn57_')=2 AND
  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.TRIGGERS WHERE BINARY TRIGGER_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY TRIGGER_NAME='asn57_state_insert' AND BINARY EVENT_OBJECT_TABLE='archive_stock_notification_state' AND ACTION_TIMING='BEFORE' AND EVENT_MANIPULATION='INSERT' AND ACTION_ORIENTATION='ROW' AND BINARY REPLACE(ACTION_STATEMENT,CHAR(13),'')=BINARY 'BEGIN
  IF COALESCE((NOT (NEW.stock_id BETWEEN 1 AND 9007199254740991 AND NEW.enabled IN (0,1) AND NEW.control_version BETWEEN 0 AND 9007199254740991 AND NEW.enabled_after_stock_version BETWEEN 0 AND 9007199254740991 AND NEW.restored_at IS NOT NULL AND NEW.updated_at IS NOT NULL AND NEW.updated_at>=NEW.restored_at) OR NEW.enabled<>0 OR NEW.control_version<>0 OR NEW.enabled_after_stock_version<>0 OR NOT (NEW.updated_at <=> NEW.restored_at)),TRUE) THEN
    SIGNAL SQLSTATE ''45000'' SET MESSAGE_TEXT = ''ASN57_STATE_INITIAL'';
  END IF;
END' AND CHARACTER_SET_CLIENT='utf8mb4' AND COLLATION_CONNECTION='utf8mb4_bin' AND (FIND_IN_SET('STRICT_TRANS_TABLES',SQL_MODE)>0 OR FIND_IN_SET('STRICT_ALL_TABLES',SQL_MODE)>0))=1 AND
  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.TRIGGERS WHERE BINARY TRIGGER_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY TRIGGER_NAME='asn57_state_update' AND BINARY EVENT_OBJECT_TABLE='archive_stock_notification_state' AND ACTION_TIMING='BEFORE' AND EVENT_MANIPULATION='UPDATE' AND ACTION_ORIENTATION='ROW' AND BINARY REPLACE(ACTION_STATEMENT,CHAR(13),'')=BINARY 'BEGIN
  IF COALESCE((NOT (NEW.stock_id BETWEEN 1 AND 9007199254740991 AND NEW.enabled IN (0,1) AND NEW.control_version BETWEEN 0 AND 9007199254740991 AND NEW.enabled_after_stock_version BETWEEN 0 AND 9007199254740991 AND NEW.restored_at IS NOT NULL AND NEW.updated_at IS NOT NULL AND NEW.updated_at>=NEW.restored_at) OR NOT (NEW.stock_id <=> OLD.stock_id) OR NOT (NEW.restored_at <=> OLD.restored_at) OR OLD.control_version>=9007199254740991 OR NEW.control_version<>OLD.control_version+1 OR NEW.enabled=OLD.enabled OR NEW.updated_at<OLD.updated_at OR NEW.enabled_after_stock_version<OLD.enabled_after_stock_version OR (NEW.enabled=0 AND NEW.enabled_after_stock_version<>OLD.enabled_after_stock_version)),TRUE) THEN
    SIGNAL SQLSTATE ''45000'' SET MESSAGE_TEXT = ''ASN57_STATE_TRANSITION'';
  END IF;
END' AND CHARACTER_SET_CLIENT='utf8mb4' AND COLLATION_CONNECTION='utf8mb4_bin' AND (FIND_IN_SET('STRICT_TRANS_TABLES',SQL_MODE)>0 OR FIND_IN_SET('STRICT_ALL_TABLES',SQL_MODE)>0))=1 AND
  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.TRIGGERS WHERE BINARY TRIGGER_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY TRIGGER_NAME='asn57_state_delete' AND BINARY EVENT_OBJECT_TABLE='archive_stock_notification_state' AND ACTION_TIMING='BEFORE' AND EVENT_MANIPULATION='DELETE' AND ACTION_ORIENTATION='ROW' AND BINARY REPLACE(ACTION_STATEMENT,CHAR(13),'')=BINARY 'BEGIN
  SIGNAL SQLSTATE ''45000'' SET MESSAGE_TEXT = ''ASN57_STATE_DIRECT_DELETE'';
END' AND CHARACTER_SET_CLIENT='utf8mb4' AND COLLATION_CONNECTION='utf8mb4_bin' AND (FIND_IN_SET('STRICT_TRANS_TABLES',SQL_MODE)>0 OR FIND_IN_SET('STRICT_ALL_TABLES',SQL_MODE)>0))=1 AND
  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.TRIGGERS WHERE BINARY TRIGGER_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY TRIGGER_NAME='asn57_command_insert' AND BINARY EVENT_OBJECT_TABLE='archive_stock_notification_command' AND ACTION_TIMING='BEFORE' AND EVENT_MANIPULATION='INSERT' AND ACTION_ORIENTATION='ROW' AND BINARY REPLACE(ACTION_STATEMENT,CHAR(13),'')=BINARY 'BEGIN
  IF COALESCE((NOT (NEW.actor_id BETWEEN 1 AND 9007199254740991 AND NEW.stock_id BETWEEN 1 AND 9007199254740991 AND NEW.expected_version BETWEEN 0 AND 9007199254740990 AND OCTET_LENGTH(NEW.command_key) BETWEEN 16 AND 64 AND BINARY NEW.command_key REGEXP ''^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_-]{15,63}$'' AND BINARY NEW.operation IN (''ENABLE'',''DISABLE'') AND OCTET_LENGTH(NEW.payload_hash)=64 AND BINARY NEW.payload_hash REGEXP ''^[0-9a-f]{64}$'' AND NEW.created_at IS NOT NULL) OR NEW.result_json IS NOT NULL OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM archive_stock_notification_state s WHERE s.stock_id=NEW.stock_id AND s.control_version=NEW.expected_version AND s.enabled=IF(BINARY NEW.operation=''ENABLE'',0,1))),TRUE) THEN
    SIGNAL SQLSTATE ''45000'' SET MESSAGE_TEXT = ''ASN57_COMMAND_INITIAL'';
  END IF;
END' AND CHARACTER_SET_CLIENT='utf8mb4' AND COLLATION_CONNECTION='utf8mb4_bin' AND (FIND_IN_SET('STRICT_TRANS_TABLES',SQL_MODE)>0 OR FIND_IN_SET('STRICT_ALL_TABLES',SQL_MODE)>0))=1 AND
  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.TRIGGERS WHERE BINARY TRIGGER_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY TRIGGER_NAME='asn57_command_update' AND BINARY EVENT_OBJECT_TABLE='archive_stock_notification_command' AND ACTION_TIMING='BEFORE' AND EVENT_MANIPULATION='UPDATE' AND ACTION_ORIENTATION='ROW' AND BINARY REPLACE(ACTION_STATEMENT,CHAR(13),'')=BINARY 'BEGIN
  IF COALESCE((OLD.result_json IS NOT NULL OR NEW.result_json IS NULL OR NOT (BINARY NEW.actor_id <=> BINARY OLD.actor_id) OR NOT (BINARY NEW.command_key <=> BINARY OLD.command_key) OR NOT (BINARY NEW.stock_id <=> BINARY OLD.stock_id) OR NOT (BINARY NEW.expected_version <=> BINARY OLD.expected_version) OR NOT (BINARY NEW.operation <=> BINARY OLD.operation) OR NOT (BINARY NEW.payload_hash <=> BINARY OLD.payload_hash) OR NOT (BINARY NEW.created_at <=> BINARY OLD.created_at)),TRUE) THEN
    SIGNAL SQLSTATE ''45000'' SET MESSAGE_TEXT = ''ASN57_COMMAND_IMMUTABLE'';
  END IF;
  IF COALESCE((NOT (JSON_VALID(NEW.result_json))),TRUE) THEN
    SIGNAL SQLSTATE ''45000'' SET MESSAGE_TEXT = ''ASN57_RECEIPT_JSON'';
  END IF;
  IF COALESCE((NOT (JSON_VALID(NEW.result_json) AND OCTET_LENGTH(NEW.result_json)<=512 AND JSON_TYPE(NEW.result_json)=''OBJECT'' AND JSON_LENGTH(NEW.result_json)=5 AND JSON_TYPE(JSON_EXTRACT(NEW.result_json,''$.stockId''))=''INTEGER'' AND JSON_UNQUOTE(JSON_EXTRACT(NEW.result_json,''$.stockId''))=NEW.stock_id AND JSON_TYPE(JSON_EXTRACT(NEW.result_json,''$.controlVersion''))=''INTEGER'' AND JSON_UNQUOTE(JSON_EXTRACT(NEW.result_json,''$.controlVersion''))=NEW.expected_version+1 AND JSON_TYPE(JSON_EXTRACT(NEW.result_json,''$.operation''))=''STRING'' AND BINARY JSON_UNQUOTE(JSON_EXTRACT(NEW.result_json,''$.operation''))=BINARY NEW.operation AND JSON_TYPE(JSON_EXTRACT(NEW.result_json,''$.enabled''))=''BOOLEAN'' AND BINARY JSON_UNQUOTE(JSON_EXTRACT(NEW.result_json,''$.enabled''))=IF(BINARY NEW.operation=''ENABLE'',''true'',''false'') AND JSON_TYPE(JSON_EXTRACT(NEW.result_json,''$.recordedAt''))=''STRING'' AND BINARY JSON_UNQUOTE(JSON_EXTRACT(NEW.result_json,''$.recordedAt''))=BINARY DATE_FORMAT(NEW.created_at,''%Y-%m-%dT%H:%i:%s.%fZ'')) OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM archive_stock_notification_state s WHERE s.stock_id=NEW.stock_id AND s.control_version=NEW.expected_version+1 AND s.enabled=IF(BINARY NEW.operation=''ENABLE'',1,0) AND s.updated_at=NEW.created_at)),TRUE) THEN
    SIGNAL SQLSTATE ''45000'' SET MESSAGE_TEXT = ''ASN57_RECEIPT_SHAPE'';
  END IF;
END' AND CHARACTER_SET_CLIENT='utf8mb4' AND COLLATION_CONNECTION='utf8mb4_bin' AND (FIND_IN_SET('STRICT_TRANS_TABLES',SQL_MODE)>0 OR FIND_IN_SET('STRICT_ALL_TABLES',SQL_MODE)>0))=1 AND
  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM information_schema.TRIGGERS WHERE BINARY TRIGGER_SCHEMA=BINARY DATABASE() AND BINARY TRIGGER_NAME='asn57_command_delete' AND BINARY EVENT_OBJECT_TABLE='archive_stock_notification_command' AND ACTION_TIMING='BEFORE' AND EVENT_MANIPULATION='DELETE' AND ACTION_ORIENTATION='ROW' AND BINARY REPLACE(ACTION_STATEMENT,CHAR(13),'')=BINARY 'BEGIN
  SIGNAL SQLSTATE ''45000'' SET MESSAGE_TEXT = ''ASN57_COMMAND_DIRECT_DELETE'';
END' AND CHARACTER_SET_CLIENT='utf8mb4' AND COLLATION_CONNECTION='utf8mb4_bin' AND (FIND_IN_SET('STRICT_TRANS_TABLES',SQL_MODE)>0 OR FIND_IN_SET('STRICT_ALL_TABLES',SQL_MODE)>0))=1
THEN 1 ELSE 0 END AS ready);
SELECT DATABASE() AS selected_schema,VERSION() AS mysql_version,IF(@asn57_ready=1,'FULLY_INSTALLED',IF(@asn57_absent,'EXACT_OLD','PARTIAL_OR_UNKNOWN')) AS policy_schema_status;
SET @asn57_guard_sql=IF(@asn57_ready=1 OR @asn57_absent,'SELECT 1 AS precondition_passed','SELECT * FROM information_schema.ASN57_STOP_PREFLIGHT');
PREPARE asn57_guard FROM @asn57_guard_sql;
EXECUTE asn57_guard;
DEALLOCATE PREPARE asn57_guard;
